  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Use this endpoint to remove a version from App Review. This request fails with an appropriate error if the app can’t be removed from review. For more information, see `https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/manage-submissions-to-app-review/remove-a-submission-from-review`.",
